OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy, with 
OL,6,Fa few showers clipping the coast,      
OL,7,Falthough most places will remain dry.  
OL,8,FTurning chilly, with a frost possible  
OL,9,Fover the Pennines. The wind remains    
OL,10,Flight inland, but becomes breezy along 
OL,11,Fthe coast.                             
OL,13,CThursday:FRather grey through          
OL,14,FThursday, although some brighter       
OL,15,Fspells are possible during the         
OL,16,Fmorning. Becoming increasingly cloudy  
OL,17,Fas the day progresses, with rain       
OL,18,Fmoving in overnight. Cold, with frost  
OL,19,Fdeveloping overnight.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
