OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,6,Fon Friday, with rain and hill snow,    
OL,7,Fturning cold overnight. Dull on        
OL,8,FSaturday, with outbreaks of heavy      
OL,9,Frain. Brighter by Sunday, with         
OL,10,Fprolonged sunny spells, although       
OL,11,Fisolated showers possible.             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
